# IFOS software catalog — Gaming
Steam|Valve's game store and launcher|steam|multilib
Lutris|Game manager for Windows, emulated and native games|lutris|repo
Heroic Games Launcher|Epic Games and GOG launcher|heroic-games-launcher-bin|aur
Wine|Run Windows applications and games|wine wine-mono wine-gecko|multilib
Proton (GE)|Community Proton builds, managed by ProtonUp-Qt|protonup-qt|aur
MangoHud|In-game FPS and hardware overlay|mangohud lib32-mangohud|multilib
GameMode|Applies performance tuning while a game runs|gamemode lib32-gamemode|multilib
Discord|Voice and text chat|discord|repo
OBS Studio|Recording and streaming|obs-studio|repo
RetroArch|Multi-system emulator front end|retroarch retroarch-assets-xmb|repo
PCSX2|PlayStation 2 emulator|pcsx2|aur
Dolphin Emulator|GameCube and Wii emulator|dolphin-emu|repo
